  {
    "uuid": "c011deab-0673-54b9-bffe-aa2839fdde57",
    "entry": "松韻",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "しょういん",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "(music of) wind through pine trees",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "静かな庭園の東屋に座り、風が運んでくる松韻に耳を傾ける。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その古琴の音色は、あたかも深い森を吹き抜ける松韻のように清らかだった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "都会の喧騒を離れ、松韻だけが響く海辺の寺院で心を落ち着かせる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "しのびで、裏町の軒へ寄ると、破屋を包む霧寒く、松韻｜颯々として、白衣の巫女が口ずさんだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "神鷺之巻",
                "author": "泉鏡花",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "芝｜琴平町、松韻社。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "六百句",
                "author": "高浜虚子",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "広間の松韻亭は、翠簾をかかげ、水を打ってあった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "新書太閤記",
                "author": "第十分冊",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
